    /// <summary>
    /// ASCII layouts for the generated demo content (top row first, one character = one 1x1 tile).
    /// Generated by a script; edit freely, then re-run Tools > Platformer Template > Build Demo Content.
    ///
    /// Legend
    ///   .  empty          #  solid ground        =  one-way platform     ^  spikes
    ///   P  player spawn   C  checkpoint          X  level exit           c  coin
    ///   p  patroller      f  flyer               s  shooter              h  charger     B  boss
    ///   1  double-jump pickup   2  wall slide + wall jump pickup   3  dash pickup   5  ranged pickup
    ///   M  moving platform (3 wide, travels 4 right)   m  spring   b  breakable block   G  ability gate (1x3)
    ///
    /// Ground surface is at y = 2. A one-way platform in row r has its walkable surface at y = r + 1.
    /// Reference: a full jump clears 4 tiles up and about 5 tiles across; keep single-jump gaps to 4.
    /// </summary>
